<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - SIDERCA Q1 NET 50 MLN PESOS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SIDERCA Q1 NET 50 MLN PESOS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30.</p>
<p>Net 50.1 million vs 38.5 million</p>
<p>Sales 224.92 million vs 218.3 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Argentine steelmaker Siderca said production in the quarter was 197,838 tonnes, compared with the same quarter last year's 192,611 tonnes. Net worth at June 30 was 1.58 billion pesos versus 1.5 billion.</p>
<p>Siderca is controlled by holding company Techint and forms a strategic alliance with Tubos de Acero de Mexico SA and Italy's Dalmine.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
